 capture or eliminate targets without  anyone knowing they were there  the other is trained to be the last line  of defense to save what remains  they are meant to be seen to support and  rebuild the communities they live in  yet they are alone and must be prepared  for the worst to happen  at any moment  there are situations that could play out  that would see either side of this  fictional battle  coming out on top but if i had to pick  which one would be better  i'd have to say that the division  agent's area of expertise is far too  specific to location  and situation and that the ghosts arena  would be considerably more flexible  given their training and experience  however i think many of you would agree  there is another type of operative  within the clancy universe not discussed  here  who if it came down to it would not only  outdo each of these agencies  but probably wouldn't even break a sweat  if they combined their forces  nomad glad you haven't gone soft since  olivia  let's go we need to talk  anyway i hope you've enjoyed this weird  little crossover speculation video  thank you very much for watching and  i'll catch in the next one cheers  [Applause]  [Music]

